    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>about us</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745980/extras/24ed2c4c59d2a4ccae04236619564dfc.poster.avif?t=1688473621\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745980/extras/24ed2c4c59d2a4ccae04236619564dfc.webm?t=1688473621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Who are we\uff1f<br>We are SHIT MAKER bro\uff01\uff01\uff01<br>Make Shit is our job^_^</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In \u300aPromotion Simulator\u300b, you will play a common person without a background who steps into the officialdom step by step. Simply click, wave, and swipe your finger to handle various demands from your colleagues, superiors, and people. With your strong decision-making power and intelligence, you will wander through the officialdom and ascend to a higher position. Every decision you make may have a corresponding impact, and if you take the wrong step, you may fall into an abyss of irreparable harm. Whether they are good or bad, please choose carefully.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745980/extras/b7a0654d19de380086de5095d700e0db.avif?t=1688473621\" /></div><br><br>Promotion to a higher official position: With your strong decision-making power and intelligence, you can wander through the officialdom, advance to a higher official position, and then share it with your friends.<br><br>Prudent decision-making: Every choice you make will have an impact on four dimensions: political performance, wealth, interpersonal relationships, and public opinion. Once one of these options loses control, you will suffer catastrophic consequences.<br><br>Rich and diverse achievements: Unlock various rare and little-known achievements and share them with your friends.",
    "about_the_game": "In \u300aPromotion Simulator\u300b, you will play a common person without a background who steps into the officialdom step by step. Simply click, wave, and swipe your finger to handle various demands from your colleagues, superiors, and people. With your strong decision-making power and intelligence, you will wander through the officialdom and ascend to a higher position. Every decision you make may have a corresponding impact, and if you take the wrong step, you may fall into an abyss of irreparable harm. Whether they are good or bad, please choose carefully.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745980/extras/b7a0654d19de380086de5095d700e0db.avif?t=1688473621\" /></div><br><br>Promotion to a higher official position: With your strong decision-making power and intelligence, you can wander through the officialdom, advance to a higher official position, and then share it with your friends.<br><br>Prudent decision-making: Every choice you make will have an impact on four dimensions: political performance, wealth, interpersonal relationships, and public opinion. Once one of these options loses control, you will suffer catastrophic consequences.<br><br>Rich and diverse achievements: Unlock various rare and little-known achievements and share them with your friends.",
    "short_description": "Do you want to be a upright official or corrupt officials\uff1fChoose your choice,Reaching the pinnacle of power.",
